      "source": "DTO to build stable JSON representations of a Spring Data <a href=\"../domain/Page.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Page</code></a>. It can either be selectively used in\ncontroller methods by calling <code>new PagedModel&lt;&gt;(page)</code> or generally activated as representation model for\n<a href=\"../domain/PageImpl.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>PageImpl</code></a> instances by setting\n<a href=\"config/EnableSpringDataWebSupport.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.data.web.config\"><code>EnableSpringDataWebSupport</code></a>'s <code>pageSerializationMode</code> to\n<a href=\"config/EnableSpringDataWebSupport.PageSerializationMode.html#VIA_DTO\"><code>EnableSpringDataWebSupport.PageSerializationMode.VIA_DTO</code></a>.",
      "translation": "DTO 用于构建 Spring Data <a href=\"../domain/Page.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Page</code></a> 的稳定 JSON 表示形式。它可以通过在控制器方法中调用 <code>new PagedModel&lt;&gt;(page)</code> 进行选择性使用，或者通过将\n<a href=\"config/EnableSpringDataWebSupport.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.data.web.config\"><code>EnableSpringDataWebSupport</code></a> 的 <code>pageSerializationMode</code> 设置为\n<a href=\"config/EnableSpringDataWebSupport.PageSerializationMode.html#VIA_DTO\"><code>EnableSpringDataWebSupport.PageSerializationMode.VIA_DTO</code></a>，将其作为\n<a href=\"../domain/PageImpl.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>PageImpl</code></a> 实例的通用表示模型进行激活。",
      "count": 1
    },
